2. MATEMAATTINEN YDIN (THE SUPREME EQUATION SET)\
ECU laskee n\'e4it\'e4 arvoja 1000 kertaa sekunnissa (1 kHz):\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Synkronointi-indeksi (Phi-Index):
\f1\b0  
\f5\fs26 Phi = ABS( (V_gps * K_abs) - (Omega_axleB * R_dynamic) )
\f1\fs24 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Vakiomomentti (Constant Torque):
\f1\b0  
\f5\fs26 T_total = T_axle_active(t) + T_axle_standby(t) = Constant
\f1\fs24 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Synkronointiteho (e-Sync Power):
\f1\b0  
\f5\fs26 P_sync = (J * Alpha) / Eta
\f1\fs24 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Energian talteenotto (KERS Recovery):
\f1\b0  
\f5\fs26 T_regen = (0.5 * J * Omega^2) / Delta_t
\f1\fs24 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Dynaaminen s\'e4de (R_dynamic):
\f1\b0  
\f5\fs26 R_dynamic = R_nominal * (1 - (Load_coeff * Pressure_psi))
\f1\fs24 \
